    {
      "beatId": "B02",
      "order": 2,
      "scriptQuote": "别拿你的短板去跟别人的长板拼。",
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B03",
      "order": 3,
      "scriptQuote": "满世界都是懂AI但不懂行业的人，套个壳就敢喊着颠覆你这个行业。",
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B04",
      "order": 4,
      "scriptQuote": "他们会的是工具，你有的，是这行里摸爬滚打攒下的一身实战经验。",
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B05",
      "order": 5,
      "scriptQuote": "客户到底为什么掏钱？",
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B06",
      "order": 6,
      "scriptQuote": "哪个环节让你半夜睡不着觉？",
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B07",
      "order": 7,
      "scriptQuote": "报价里的水分藏在什么地方？",
      "primaryRoute": "paper-editorial",
      "routeCueId": "P01",
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B08",
      "order": 8,
      "scriptQuote": "这些东西，不在任何一篇AI教程里，全是你一脚一坑踩出来的。",
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B09",
      "order": 9,
      "scriptQuote": "未来的王者，是应用洞察+技术能力的结合。",
      "primaryRoute": "paper-editorial",
      "routeCueId": "P02",
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B10",
      "order": 10,
      "scriptQuote": "对我们普通人来说，哪有什么高大上的应用洞察？",
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B11",
      "order": 11,
      "scriptQuote": "就是你在一个行业里泡了十年，攒下的那身“伤”。",
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B12",
      "order": 12,
      "scriptQuote": "拿这身行业底子去配AI，你就是那个既懂淘金、又最先领到铲子的人。",
      "primaryRoute": "paper-editorial",
      "routeCueId": "P03",
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B13",
      "order": 13,
      "scriptQuote": "别搞什么宏大叙事，先在一个最小的场景里把钱收回来，比什么都管用。",
      "primaryRoute": "paper-editorial",
      "routeCueId": "P04",
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B14",
      "order": 14,
      "scriptQuote": "再讲一句反常识的：",
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B15",
      "order": 15,
      "scriptQuote": "别总想着要活到终局，先把这十年的钱赚到。",
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B16",
      "order": 16,
      "scriptQuote": "很多人说，现在做AI的公司，以后大概率都活不下去。",
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B17",
      "order": 17,
      "scriptQuote": "那又怎么样？",
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B18",
      "order": 18,
      "scriptQuote": "AOL死了，不等于1995年开网吧、做网站、卖黄页的人没赚钱；",
      "primaryRoute": "real-evidence",
      "routeCueId": "R01",
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B19",
      "order": 19,
      "scriptQuote": "黑莓输了，也不等于最早一批做手机应用的团队没吃到肉。",
      "primaryRoute": "real-evidence",
      "routeCueId": "R02",
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B20",
      "order": 20,
      "scriptQuote": "商业史上大把这样的公司：",
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B21",
      "order": 21,
      "scriptQuote": "自己没走到终局，但创始人在浪潮里赚足了第一桶金，攒下了认知、团队和胆子，转身就投了下一波。",
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B22",
      "order": 22,
      "scriptQuote": "我们普通人的目标，从来都不是成为下一个OpenAI。",
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B23",
      "order": 23,
      "scriptQuote": "而是让这轮浪潮，实实在在托你一把。",
      "primaryRoute": "speaker",
      "routeCueId": null,
      "spokenQuote": null,
      "startFrame": null,
      "endFrame": null
    },
    {
      "beatId": "B24",
